Z||000007||MinnGreenGT||10-12-2001||09:33 AM||||The owner (*Kazumasa Okayama who is oriental BTW) is a really cool guy.  I was parked next to him at Fierorama, and originally saw the car at the Dells run this year.  He's got a beautiful V8 (LT1 I assume) as well as many other cool features like the complete wood grain interior, a-pilliar gauge pods, white face guages... leather seats(?) and just about every other dress-up item you can imagine!  What an awsome car!<P>*Thanks Archie for his name  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 10-12-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||MinnGreenGT||10-12-2001||09:35 AM||||Here's another of the car at Fierorama... wish I'd taken more. Oh yeah, he took home the "*Rich Warber" award at the show!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/warberwinner.jpg">  <P>*Edit: Corrected name- My deepest apology.<p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 10-13-2001).]||||reg||1
