Z||000010||Archie||10-12-2001||10:01 AM||||To liven things up a little bit here, I've decided to start posting up a few items we've been putting out letely.<P>This car is owned by "Koz" Kazumasa Okayama who lives in the Chicago area.<P>Most of the exterior work was done by Bob Steiger of Twin Lakes Fiero. We did the engine work which is a new ZZ4 355 HP Chevy crate engine with TPI.<P>We are all glad you like it. Especially Koz, a NIFE member, who is one of the nicest guys you'll ever meet.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-229s.jpg">  <P>Archie||||reg||1
