Z||000018||MinnGreenGT||10-12-2001||01:15 PM||||I seem to recall a complete budget in excess of $40k.  The paint is a high-metallic pearl off-white, he's also got (archie's?) a big-brake upgrade kit.  The more time you spend up close to it, the more details you see!||||reg||1
Z||000019||Archie||10-12-2001||01:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MinnGreenGT:<BR><B>I seem to recall a complete budget in excess of $40k.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I know he also imported the Wheels from Japan.<P>I haven't heard the $40K number but I'll bet it's close to that if you include all the previous engine work he has had done to the car.<P>He had a 3.1 in it, that wasn't enough, so he had a 3.4 put in it. The 3.4 was only enough power for a month or so and he was considering a 3.8 then decided to just put a V-8 in it and have it over with. Almost all of the work was farmed out so that $40K number would include everything you see plus 3 engine swaps and all the labor etc.<P>Archie||||reg||1
