Z||000035||MinnGreenGT||10-13-2001||09:45 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dave Gunsul:<P>Don't mean to pick on you Minngreen but it's<BR>called the "Rich Warber" award. The best of show award was named that to honor a very good NIFE member that passed away.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Dave- I apologize greatly for my mistake.  I know some about Rich, and I've heard a tremendous amount about what a great person he was- and how much he is missed.  I'm sorry I biffed the name (which has since been corrected).  Thank you for pointing out my mistake- my intention was to show that a car this great was honored with the prestigous award in his memory.<P>-RCB||||reg||1
