Z||000043||SLYGUY||10-14-2001||02:16 AM||||I really liked it till I saw the interior. Since when does wood belong inside a car? I always thought that if the owner just had to have wood, he would get something like birdseye maple in his Lexus or MB or something like that. It doesn't look cheap, but I'm not sure what it is trying to say. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  <P>I really liked the steering wheel though. Futuristic but luxurious at the same time. Very nice. <BR>You would probably need a five point safety harness and window nets to stay seated if he decided to play around with all 355 horses that V8 has!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly||||reg||1
