Z||000049||FieroLisa||10-14-2001||10:05 PM||||GTMike: There's a lot of controversy about Northstars and 5 speeds. Most of the Northstar Fieros now have the Caddy auto tranny but it weighs an extra 500 lbs over the getrag. I know some people are workin on the Northstar/5 speed and only time will tell whether it will be reliable enough...<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif">     <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>AIM: FieroLisa||||reg||1
